/T (      Balance the heaps - The difference between the number        of elements in the Min Heap and the Max Heap should        not exceed 1. This ensures that the median will always be        at the root of either the Min Heap or the Max Heap \(or        the average of the roots if the heaps have equal size\).)
/E (      Balance the heaps - The difference between the number        of elements in the Min Heap and the Max Heap should        not exceed 1. This ensures that the median will always be        at the root of either the Min Heap or the Max Heap \(or        the average of the roots if the heaps have equal size\).)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
