1599 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (      Accessing the median -        - If both heaps have the same number of elements, the          median will be the average of the roots of the two         heaps.       - If the heaps have different sizes, the median will be the          root of the heap with more elements.)
/E (      Accessing the median -        - If both heaps have the same number of elements, the          median will be the average of the roots of the two         heaps.       - If the heaps have different sizes, the median will be the          root of the heap with more elements.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
