1600 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (      Inserting elements -       - Compare the new element with the current median.       - If the new element is smaller than or equal to the           current median, insert it into the Max Heap.       - If the new element is greater than the current median,           insert it into the Min Heap.)
/E (      Inserting elements -       - Compare the new element with the current median.       - If the new element is smaller than or equal to the           current median, insert it into the Max Heap.       - If the new element is greater than the current median,           insert it into the Min Heap.)
/Pg 35 0 R
>>
endobj
